# Operating system

- Read `AGENTS.md`, `docs/sdlc/README.md`, the PRD, implementation plan, Feature RD index, and relevant Feature RD before implementation.
- Confirm the Engineering PRD is approved and the Feature RD traces to its requirement IDs.
- Do not implement an unapproved Feature RD.
- Make the smallest coherent change that satisfies acceptance criteria.
- Preserve unrelated work and report exact verification evidence.
- Build, Validate, Ship, and Deploy are distinct actions defined in the DEAP AI SDLC Playbook.
- Run `npm run sdlc:check` before claiming readiness for validation or review.
- External actions require explicit human authorization.

